  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit shown, find <math><mi>C</mi></math> if the effective capacitance of the whole circuit is to be <math><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></math> All values in the circuit are in <math><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><img height=\"236\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5facdcc3-7de1-463d-a7de-4e597d888d1e-image.png\" width=\"300\" /></p>",
