  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let us take the equivalent circuit one by one.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bbb088c0-aedb-467b-8e0d-18b62e08c1ff-image.png\" style=\"width: 403px; height: 200px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f424bc2a-fe45-482c-bacf-9efca9308b2e-image.png\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/efd508c8-8074-4453-b9a8-8509697dcedf-image.png\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math> = 0.5 <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></math></p>",
